 experienced software developers\n\n- Learn proprietary methodologies and trading systems that support an established low-latency, algorithmic trading business\n\n- Improve and extend the core trading platform, enhance existing trades, and identify and pursue new opportunities\n\n- Further responsibilities may be driven by the individual’s interests and specific skills\n\nRequirements:\n\n- 0-7 years of experience in a related field\n\n- Highly proficient in C++; experience with modern C++ (such as smart pointers)\n\n- Strong work ethic, detail oriented, and ability to learn quickly in a fast-paced environment\n\n- Interest in algorithmic trading\n\n- Experience doing highly performant, low-level C++ work\n\nBenefits:\n\n- Discretionary bonus eligibility\n\n- Medical, dental, and vision insurance\n\n- HSA , FSA , and Dependent Care Options\n\n- Employer Paid Group Term Life and AD&D insurance\n\n- Voluntary LTD, Life & AD&D insurance\n\n- Flexible Vacation policy\n\n- Retirement plan with employer match\n\n- Paid Parental Leave\n\n- Wellness Programs\n\nDV is not accepting unsolicited resumes from search firms. Only search firms with valid, written agreements with DV should submit resumes in response to DV ’s posted positions. All resumes submitted by search firms to DV via e-mail, the Internet, personal delivery, facsimile, or any other method without a valid written agreement shall be deemed the sole property of DV , and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by DV . DV is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.","description_html":"<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1\" data-local-id=\"5d6d5c6caa36\"><strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">About Us</strong>:<br>Founded 20 years ago and headquartered in Chicago, the <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\"><span class=\"_kqswh2mm\"><span class=\"_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke\" data-testid=\"definition-highlighter\">DV</span></span></span> Group of financial services firms has grown to more than 600 people operating throughout North America, Europe and Asia. Since spinning out of a large brokerage firm in 2016, <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\">DV</span> Trading has rapidly scaled as an independent proprietary trading firm utilizing its own capital, trading strategies, and risk management methodologies to provide liquidity to worldwide financial markets and hedging opportunities to commodity producers and users. Now, <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\">DV</span> group affiliates include two broker dealers, a cryptocurrency market making firm, and a bourgeoning investment adviser.</p>\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"641\" data-local-id=\"3db7b8c101de\"><strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Overview: <br></strong><span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\">We are seeking a highly motivated, quick-learning developer for our algorithmic software development team. In this role, you will be involved in the development of our cutting-edge, low-latency trading platform, which competes in the most competitive markets in the world.</span></p>\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"706\" data-local-id=\"6d17a07f558d\"><strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Job Responsibilities:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Work alongside senior traders and experienced software developers</li>\n<li>Learn proprietary methodologies and trading systems that support an established low-latency, algorithmic trading business</li>\n<li>Improve and extend the core trading platform, enhance existing trades, and identify and pursue new opportunities</li>\n<li>Further responsibilities may be driven by the individual’s interests and specific skills</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"731\" data-local-id=\"db73e6d3f6c4\"><strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>0-7 years of experience in a related field</li>\n<li>Highly proficient in C++; experience with modern C++ (such as smart pointers)</li>\n<li>Strong work ethic, detail oriented, and ability to learn quickly in a fast-paced environment</li>\n<li>Interest in algorithmic trading</li>\n<li>Experience doing highly performant, low-level C++ work</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"748\" data-local-id=\"1ac93e0b889c\"><strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Benefits: </strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-renderer-start-pos=\"762\" data-local-id=\"43734d363c8a\">Discretionary bonus eligibility</li>\n<li data-renderer-start-pos=\"797\" data-local-id=\"a08acdf8520b\">Medical, dental, and vision insurance</li>\n<li data-renderer-start-pos=\"838\" data-local-id=\"7c4c48c65bb1\"><span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\"><span class=\"_kqswh2mm\"><span class=\"_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke\" data-testid=\"definition-highlighter\">HSA</span></span></span>, <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\"><span class=\"_kqswh2mm\"><span class=\"_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke\" data-testid=\"definition-highlighter\">FSA</span></span></span>, and Dependent Care Options</li>\n<li data-renderer-start-pos=\"878\" data-local-id=\"ddceb7e8e8de\">Employer Paid Group Term Life and <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\"><span class=\"_kqswh2mm\"><span class=\"_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke\" data-testid=\"definition-highlighter\">AD&amp;D</span></span></span> insurance</li>\n<li data-renderer-start-pos=\"930\" data-local-id=\"ea26f188d5d5\">Voluntary LTD, Life &amp; <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\">AD&amp;D</span> insurance</li>\n<li data-renderer-start-pos=\"970\" data-local-id=\"65b887baed88\">Flexible Vacation policy</li>\n<li data-renderer-start-pos=\"998\" data-local-id=\"45d06bafbe62\">Retirement plan with employer match</li>\n<li data-renderer-start-pos=\"1037\" data-local-id=\"89271ebd77b6\">Paid Parental Leave</li>\n<li data-renderer-start-pos=\"1060\" data-local-id=\"193df9bdc8c0\">Wellness Programs</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1082\" data-local-id=\"7c97748d1955\"><em data-renderer-mark=\"true\"><span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\">DV</span> is not accepting unsolicited resumes from search firms. Only search firms with valid, written agreements with <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\">DV</span> should submit resumes in response to <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\">DV</span>’s posted positions. All resumes submitted by search firms to <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\">DV</span> via e-mail, the Internet, personal delivery, facsimile, or any other method without a valid written agreement shall be deemed the sole property of <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\">DV</span>, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\">DV</span>. <span data-highlighted=\"true\" data-vc=\"highlighted-text\">DV</span> is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.</em></p>","compensation":[],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Developer","Developer"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Developer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["quant"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:5459cb9d-5396-4729-9507-22729582781a","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"5459cb9d-5396-4729-9507-22729582781a","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"d8a28564d4cf080c71f882692b818e1eddaeb794c21979d32ee3e67d5ddd76ae","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - ANZ","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/5459cb9d-5396-4729-9507-22729582781a","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/5459cb9d-5396-4729-9507-22729582781a/application","locations":[{"label":"Australia","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Australia","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"remote","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-07-20T01:21:20.786+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\n\nABOUT ELEVENLABS \n\nElevenLabs is a research and product company defining the frontier of Audio AI. Millions of individuals use ElevenLabs to read articles, voice over their videos, and reclaim voices lost from disability. And the leading developers and enterprises use ElevenLabs to create AI agents for support, sales, and education.\n\nElevenLabs launched in January 2023 with the first AI model to cross the threshold of human-like speech. In January 2025, we raised a $180 million Series C round, valuing ElevenLabs at $3.3 billion. The round was co-led by Andreessen Horowitz and ICONIQ Growth, with continued support from the leading names in tech, including Nat Friedman, Daniel Gross, Instagram co-founder Mike Krieger, Oculus VR co-founder Brendan Iribe, DeepMind and Inflection co-founder Mustafa Suleyman, and many others.\n\nElevenLabs is only 2 years old and scaling rapidly. We are just getting started. If you want to work hard and have an incredible impact, we would love to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location. We are remote first with optional in-person offices in London, New York, San Francisco, Tokyo, and Warsaw.\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Learning & development: Annual discretionary stipend towards professional development. \n\n - Social travel: Annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: We bring the entire company together at a new location every year.\n\n - Coworking: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly coworking stipend.\n\n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n\n\nLOCATION\n\nThis role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in ANZ, with a preference of Sydney. Expect regular travel for customer onsites.\n\n\n\n#LI-Remote\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About ElevenLabs </strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is a research and product company defining the frontier of Audio AI. Millions of individuals use ElevenLabs to read articles, voice over their videos, and reclaim voices lost from disability. And the leading developers and enterprises use ElevenLabs to create AI agents for support, sales, and education.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs launched in January 2023 with the first AI model to cross the threshold of human-like speech. In January 2025, we raised a $180 million Series C round, valuing ElevenLabs at $3.3 billion. The round was co-led by Andreessen Horowitz and ICONIQ Growth, with continued support from the leading names in tech, including Nat Friedman, Daniel Gross, Instagram co-founder Mike Krieger, Oculus VR co-founder Brendan Iribe, DeepMind and Inflection co-founder Mustafa Suleyman, and many others.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is only 2 years old and scaling rapidly. We are just getting started. If you want to work hard and have an incredible impact, we would love to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location. We are remote first with optional in-person offices in London, New York, San Francisco, Tokyo, and Warsaw.</p></li></ul><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: Annual discretionary stipend towards professional development. </p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: Annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite:</strong> We bring the entire company together at a new location every year.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Coworking</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly coworking stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p></li></ul><h2>Location</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in ANZ, with a preference of Sydney. Expect regular travel for customer onsites.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-Remote</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:44c6b5f3-e135-4f3b-b286-7baccf782912","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"44c6b5f3-e135-4f3b-b286-7baccf782912","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"36a132c16fbd36904447dc6e047d1348383fc4f778f30bd19b4551321fe2dc14","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - Belgium","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/44c6b5f3-e135-4f3b-b286-7baccf782912","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/44c6b5f3-e135-4f3b-b286-7baccf782912/application","locations":[{"label":"Belgium","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Belgium","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-08-10T21:55:51.813+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n   \n   Location\n   \n   This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Belgium, with a preference of Brussels. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English, French, and Dutch and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.\n\n#LI-remote\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Belgium, with a preference of Brussels. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English, French, and Dutch and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-remote</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:6ce3306e-a546-4e11-83d6-3eaff5dd366b","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"6ce3306e-a546-4e11-83d6-3eaff5dd366b","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"7ac3318284ca45ad65e0ff13b3a84a7f15244e2e0d60c692a5c39315f8c85bbd","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - Brazil","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/6ce3306e-a546-4e11-83d6-3eaff5dd366b","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/6ce3306e-a546-4e11-83d6-3eaff5dd366b/application","locations":[{"label":"Brazil","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Brazil","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"on_site","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-07-20T02:08:49.062+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\nThis role is remote, so it can be executed globally. \n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n\nLocation\n\n - This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Brazil, with a preference of Sao Paolo. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Portuguese and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote, so it can be executed globally. <br /></p><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location</strong></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Brazil, with a preference of Sao Paolo. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Portuguese and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:a4ccd185-8576-4f69-aa8d-454f323cc024","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"a4ccd185-8576-4f69-aa8d-454f323cc024","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"8a3fc7f574d701b7cccc99f0710f93dbf1ec27588fdfc5522fc8b65cbd6224fb","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - Canada","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/a4ccd185-8576-4f69-aa8d-454f323cc024","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/a4ccd185-8576-4f69-aa8d-454f323cc024/application","locations":[{"label":"Canada","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Canada","remote":null,"hybrid":null},{"label":"Toronto","city":"Toronto","region":"Ontario","country":"Canada","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"hybrid","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-08-10T22:02:26.426+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\nAbout the role\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n   \n   Location\n   \n   This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Canada, however there is a preference for candidates to be based out of Toronto. Expect regular travel for customer onsites.\n\n#LI-remote\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the role</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Canada, however there is a preference for candidates to be based out of Toronto. Expect regular travel for customer onsites.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-remote</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:16ed3af9-e4a7-4b59-8767-7771604d9165","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"16ed3af9-e4a7-4b59-8767-7771604d9165","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"bd254ba8d53c1476cf1672f7b4226470f6b1745a842574abded674b44b472a22","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - Denmark","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/16ed3af9-e4a7-4b59-8767-7771604d9165","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/16ed3af9-e4a7-4b59-8767-7771604d9165/application","locations":[{"label":"Denmark","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Denmark","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"remote","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-08-17T21:15:43.802+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\nAbout the role\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n \n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n   \n   Location\n   \n   This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Denmark, however there is a preference for candidates to be based out of Copenhagen. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Danish and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the role</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Denmark, however there is a preference for candidates to be based out of Copenhagen. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Danish and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:38e0b741-5bfa-4481-891e-e95b503d4aff","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"38e0b741-5bfa-4481-891e-e95b503d4aff","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"b0fe40e579766e35dc25027a100ddafdd212f1d8b271d269f645e13aa332d56e","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - France","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/38e0b741-5bfa-4481-891e-e95b503d4aff","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/38e0b741-5bfa-4481-891e-e95b503d4aff/application","locations":[{"label":"France","city":null,"region":null,"country":"France","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"remote","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-08-10T22:12:46.963+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\nThis role is remote, so it can be executed globally. \n\n\n\n\nABOUT ELEVENLABS \n\nElevenLabs is a research and product company defining the frontier of Audio AI. Millions of individuals use ElevenLabs to read articles, voice over their videos, and reclaim voices lost from disability. And the leading developers and enterprises use ElevenLabs to create AI agents for support, sales, and education.\n\nElevenLabs launched in January 2023 with the first AI model to cross the threshold of human-like speech. In January 2025, we raised a $180 million Series C round, valuing ElevenLabs at $3.3 billion. The round was co-led by Andreessen Horowitz and ICONIQ Growth, with continued support from the leading names in tech, including Nat Friedman, Daniel Gross, Instagram co-founder Mike Krieger, Oculus VR co-founder Brendan Iribe, DeepMind and Inflection co-founder Mustafa Suleyman, and many others.\n\nElevenLabs is only 2 years old and scaling rapidly. We are just getting started. If you want to work hard and have an incredible impact, we would love to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location. We are remote first with optional in-person offices in London, New York, San Francisco, Tokyo, and Warsaw.\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Learning & development: Annual discretionary stipend towards professional development. \n\n - Social travel: Annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: We bring the entire company together at a new location every year.\n\n - Coworking: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly coworking stipend.\n\n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n   \n   Location\n   \n   This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in France, with a preference of Paris. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and French and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.\n   \n   \n\n#LI-remote\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote, so it can be executed globally. </p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>About ElevenLabs </strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is a research and product company defining the frontier of Audio AI. Millions of individuals use ElevenLabs to read articles, voice over their videos, and reclaim voices lost from disability. And the leading developers and enterprises use ElevenLabs to create AI agents for support, sales, and education.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs launched in January 2023 with the first AI model to cross the threshold of human-like speech. In January 2025, we raised a $180 million Series C round, valuing ElevenLabs at $3.3 billion. The round was co-led by Andreessen Horowitz and ICONIQ Growth, with continued support from the leading names in tech, including Nat Friedman, Daniel Gross, Instagram co-founder Mike Krieger, Oculus VR co-founder Brendan Iribe, DeepMind and Inflection co-founder Mustafa Suleyman, and many others.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is only 2 years old and scaling rapidly. We are just getting started. If you want to work hard and have an incredible impact, we would love to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location. We are remote first with optional in-person offices in London, New York, San Francisco, Tokyo, and Warsaw.</p></li></ul><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: Annual discretionary stipend towards professional development. </p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: Annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite:</strong> We bring the entire company together at a new location every year.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Coworking</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly coworking stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in France, with a preference of Paris. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and French and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-remote</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:b1b4fa6b-ad36-4b0d-be89-32f35fcb420a","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"b1b4fa6b-ad36-4b0d-be89-32f35fcb420a","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"e7f31ac86413f8694b8251e1f39ef795c1b5ece2b79bbe4d72a1f566192376ef","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - Germany","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/b1b4fa6b-ad36-4b0d-be89-32f35fcb420a","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/b1b4fa6b-ad36-4b0d-be89-32f35fcb420a/application","locations":[{"label":"Germany","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Germany","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"remote","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-08-17T21:12:14.079+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\nAbout the role\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n \n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n   \n   Location\n   \n   This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Germany, however there is a preference for candidates to be based out of Berlin. Fluency in English and German and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.\n   \n   #LI-remote\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the role</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Germany, however there is a preference for candidates to be based out of Berlin. Fluency in English and German and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-remote</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:cd610558-4a8e-4746-81c1-10e3902f5576","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"cd610558-4a8e-4746-81c1-10e3902f5576","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"9aaac49476beb8cd0698d8fd05f3dcc9c457ac2ef6f059b903538df84ba3fca9","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - Italy","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/cd610558-4a8e-4746-81c1-10e3902f5576","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/cd610558-4a8e-4746-81c1-10e3902f5576/application","locations":[{"label":"Italy","city":"","region":null,"country":"Italy","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"remote","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-08-10T22:20:40.583+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\nThis role is remote, so it can be executed globally. \n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n   \n   Location\n   \n   This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Italy, with a preference of Milan. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Italian and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.\n\n#LI-remote\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote, so it can be executed globally. <br /></p><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Italy, with a preference of Milan. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Italian and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-remote</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:39d438fa-8070-4660-968b-055493860c4c","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"39d438fa-8070-4660-968b-055493860c4c","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"713360581fb8ed9b4be2747960d3ac194ebb8755fa4f2489ca69dcc2af08e333","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - LATAM","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/39d438fa-8070-4660-968b-055493860c4c","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/39d438fa-8070-4660-968b-055493860c4c/application","locations":[{"label":"Mexico","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Mexico","remote":null,"hybrid":null},{"label":"Chile","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Chile","remote":null,"hybrid":null},{"label":"Peru","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Peru","remote":null,"hybrid":null},{"label":"Argentina","city":"","region":null,"country":"Argentina","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"remote","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-07-20T02:37:37.676+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n   \n   Location\n   \n   As we build out a team in the Spanish LATAM region, the successful candidate is preferred to be based within the Spanish LATAM Region. We will also consider candidates who can travel frequently to meet with customers on-site and collaborate in person with the team. Fluency in English and Spanish and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As we build out a team in the Spanish LATAM region, the successful candidate is preferred to be based within the Spanish LATAM Region. We will also consider candidates who can travel frequently to meet with customers on-site and collaborate in person with the team. Fluency in English and Spanish and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:50d20869-819d-4ae3-be8d-71c3c9bf3394","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"50d20869-819d-4ae3-be8d-71c3c9bf3394","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"0bb913ee79d0102929389636c09bae18ca7744f66aef1c2c5c4c82f91d2e3ed5","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - Netherlands","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/50d20869-819d-4ae3-be8d-71c3c9bf3394","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/50d20869-819d-4ae3-be8d-71c3c9bf3394/application","locations":[{"label":"Netherlands","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Netherlands","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"remote","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-08-10T22:19:02.358+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\nThis role is remote, so it can be executed globally. \n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n   \n   Location\n   \n   This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in The Netherlands, with a preference of Amsterdam. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Dutch and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.\n\n#LI-remote\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote, so it can be executed globally. <br /></p><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in The Netherlands, with a preference of Amsterdam. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Dutch and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-remote</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:29aed1f3-26f8-4d3b-8cc4-7ca7d9342eeb","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"29aed1f3-26f8-4d3b-8cc4-7ca7d9342eeb","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"53b27d1228efb841a18b84dab35284896668b221d057f2be093a9d89d9bc6f1f","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - Poland","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/29aed1f3-26f8-4d3b-8cc4-7ca7d9342eeb","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/29aed1f3-26f8-4d3b-8cc4-7ca7d9342eeb/application","locations":[{"label":"Poland","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Poland","remote":null,"hybrid":null},{"label":"Warsaw","city":"Warsaw","region":"Poland","country":"Poland","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"remote","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-08-18T15:01:36.078+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n \n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n   \n   Location\n   \n   This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Poland, with a preference of Warsaw. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Polish and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Poland, with a preference of Warsaw. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Polish and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:c8216d65-13c9-4f8c-9b57-e14fd02738b0","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"c8216d65-13c9-4f8c-9b57-e14fd02738b0","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"f159fc28627a408a0acd6250569ed03032f93426cf1a620653aa8be5a5c24bbe","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - Saudi Arabia","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/c8216d65-13c9-4f8c-9b57-e14fd02738b0","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/c8216d65-13c9-4f8c-9b57-e14fd02738b0/application","locations":[{"label":"Saudi Arabia","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Saudi Arabia","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-08-17T21:58:45.009+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\nAbout the role\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n \n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n   \n   Location\n   \n   This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Saudi Arabia, however there is a preference for candidates to be based out of Riyadh. Fluency in English and Arabic and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required\n\n#LI-remote\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the role</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Saudi Arabia, however there is a preference for candidates to be based out of Riyadh. Fluency in English and Arabic and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-remote</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:36bdb528-004b-482c-8924-33b27b76121f","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"36bdb528-004b-482c-8924-33b27b76121f","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"74a265b78414720493e57fd961f29d3df94eaa31849b4ba35f818405be8ceb9e","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - Singapore","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/36bdb528-004b-482c-8924-33b27b76121f","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/36bdb528-004b-482c-8924-33b27b76121f/application","locations":[{"label":"Singapore","city":"Singapore","region":null,"country":"Singapore","remote":null,"hybrid":null},{"label":"Japan","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Japan","remote":null,"hybrid":null},{"label":"Taiwan","city":null,"region":null,"country":null,"remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"remote","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-05-27T20:54:02.664+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS \n\nElevenLabs is a research and product company defining the frontier of Audio AI. Millions of individuals use ElevenLabs to read articles, voice over their videos, and reclaim voices lost from disability. And the leading developers and enterprises use ElevenLabs to create AI agents for support, sales, and education.\n\nElevenLabs launched in January 2023 with the first AI model to cross the threshold of human-like speech. In January 2025, we raised a $180 million Series C round, valuing ElevenLabs at $3.3 billion. The round was co-led by Andreessen Horowitz and ICONIQ Growth, with continued support from the leading names in tech, including Nat Friedman, Daniel Gross, Instagram co-founder Mike Krieger, Oculus VR co-founder Brendan Iribe, DeepMind and Inflection co-founder Mustafa Suleyman, and many others.\n\nElevenLabs is only 2 years old and scaling rapidly. We are just getting started. If you want to work hard and have an incredible impact, we would love to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location. We are remote first with optional in-person offices in London, New York, San Francisco, Tokyo, and Warsaw.\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Learning & development: Annual discretionary stipend towards professional development. \n\n - Social travel: Annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: We bring the entire company together at a new location every year.\n\n - Coworking: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly coworking stipend.\n\n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n\n - Multi-lingual: Mandarin/English \n\n\n\nLOCATION\n\nAs we build out a team in the Singapore office, the successful candidate is preferred to be based within Singapore. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Mandarin and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2><strong>About ElevenLabs </strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is a research and product company defining the frontier of Audio AI. Millions of individuals use ElevenLabs to read articles, voice over their videos, and reclaim voices lost from disability. And the leading developers and enterprises use ElevenLabs to create AI agents for support, sales, and education.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs launched in January 2023 with the first AI model to cross the threshold of human-like speech. In January 2025, we raised a $180 million Series C round, valuing ElevenLabs at $3.3 billion. The round was co-led by Andreessen Horowitz and ICONIQ Growth, with continued support from the leading names in tech, including Nat Friedman, Daniel Gross, Instagram co-founder Mike Krieger, Oculus VR co-founder Brendan Iribe, DeepMind and Inflection co-founder Mustafa Suleyman, and many others.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is only 2 years old and scaling rapidly. We are just getting started. If you want to work hard and have an incredible impact, we would love to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location. We are remote first with optional in-person offices in London, New York, San Francisco, Tokyo, and Warsaw.</p></li></ul><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: Annual discretionary stipend towards professional development. </p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: Annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite:</strong> We bring the entire company together at a new location every year.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Coworking</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly coworking stipend.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Multi-lingual: Mandarin/English </p></li></ul><h2><br /><strong>Location</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As we build out a team in the Singapore office, the successful candidate is preferred to be based within Singapore. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Mandarin and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"ashby:elevenlabs:7664e3c4-2336-4d1a-90cf-91d1268de10d","source":{"type":"ashby","board":"elevenlabs","job_id":"7664e3c4-2336-4d1a-90cf-91d1268de10d","source_url":"https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/elevenlabs","response_hash":"7b6d6582f958dc0bc15872e74f9991c280f1a8c1c9385111f2aa0218898a524e","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z"},"company":{"name":"ElevenLabs","slug":"elevenlabs","lists":["ai-ml"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - Software Engineer - Spain","canonical_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/7664e3c4-2336-4d1a-90cf-91d1268de10d","apply_url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/elevenlabs/7664e3c4-2336-4d1a-90cf-91d1268de10d/application","locations":[{"label":"Spain","city":null,"region":null,"country":"Spain","remote":null,"hybrid":null}],"workplace_type":"remote","employment_type":"full_time","departments":["Engineering & Product"],"teams":["Enterprise - Deployment"],"language":null,"requisition_id":null,"internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":"2026-05-05T19:43:31.419+00:00","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"ABOUT ELEVENLABS\n\nElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.\n\nWe launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.\n\nWe have expanded from voice into three main platforms:\n\n - ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.\n\n - ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.\n\n - ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.\n\nEverything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.\n\n\n\n\nHOW WE WORK\n\n - High-velocity: Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.\n\n - Impact not job titles: We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.\n\n - AI first: We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.\n\n - Excellence everywhere: Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.\n\n - Global team: We prioritize your talent, not your location.\n\n\n\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n\n - Innovative culture: You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n - Growth paths: Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.\n\n - Learning & development: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.\n\n - Social travel: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.\n\n - Annual company offsite: Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.\n\n - Co-working: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nYou’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.\n\nEmbedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.\n\nWhat you will do:\n\n - Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.\n\n - Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.\n\n - Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.\n\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity\n\n - Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.\n\n - Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.\n\n\nLOCATION\n\nThis role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Spain, with a preference of Madrid. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Spanish and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.\n\n\n\n#LI-remote\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.","description_html":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $11B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll use your creativity, problem-solving, and technical expertise to design tailored solutions that make a real impact.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embedded with our most strategic customers, you’ll get a front-row seat to some of our highest-stakes projects. From brainstorming technical architectures and product features to building full-scale integrations, you’ll take full ownership of complex, high-impact challenges—helping clients achieve their goals and push the limits of what’s possible.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of end-to-end execution of major projects for our most strategic partners, working hands-on to deliver high-impact solutions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our customer’s engineers and executives teams to ensure the best use of ElevenLabs’ technologies.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive real innovation by using your coding and technical skills to solve complex problems, making a real difference for our customers.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with customers. It’s ok if you only worked with customers in student clubs or side projects, as long as you are interested in working closely with them on a technical capacity</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python and strong software development knowledge, inclusive of a deep understanding of software development, software architecture, and APIs integration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills. Especially in terms of ability to summarize complex technical knowledge and using logic in pursuing optimal solutions.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Location</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere in Spain, with a preference of Madrid. Expect regular travel for customer onsites. Fluency in English and Spanish and a deep understanding of the regional and cultural nuances is required.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-remote</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p>","compensation":[{"type":"salary","summary":null,"salary_summary":null,"tiers":[]}],"custom_fields":{},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T03:47:44.181Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T09:13:58.725Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":5,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer","Forward Deployed"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["ai-ml"]}}
